  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_cement",
      "name": {
        "en": "Cement's Badge",
        "zh": "洋灰证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_cement",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Cement has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for head-on enemy confrontation contemporaneous with resistance to harm.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Defender Operator during field operations to exercise Duelist responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员洋灰擅长在抵挡伤害的同时迎战敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为重装干员，行使决战者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_cement",
      "name": {
        "en": "Engineering Recorder",
        "zh": "工程记录仪",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_cement",
      "description": {
        "en": "'Found it, bloody hell. Would've been an earful from the boss if I came in tomorrow without. Say, what point does she have giving us all one of these... works recorder thingym'bobs?'\n'You think I'd have a clue? Yours's been on the whole time. See how you lost it in the first place, maybe?'\n'Sure.'\n\n[Display View] Before clocking out, a worker tosses the recorder aside as he changes.\n'Hahah, my arse someone took it. You lost it your own silly self.'\n'Shtum.'\n\n[Display View] Not long after the worker leaves, Shana suddenly appears in the workplace.\n'Wait, that's the boss, nah?'\n\n[Display View] Shana checks over the equipment for wear and tear, tweaking any gummed-up specimens one by one. She stops before a drilling rig, and fishes out a notebook to write in.\n'Y'know, it stumped me how our machines worked like such a charm without our tiny team having any maintenance people. S'pose the boss did all the work.'\n'That's the Brooks' driller. Definitely had a bit of dullness digging up the rock the day before. They just kept on using it, but I guess the boss noticed straight away.'\n'All our drills are her upgrades, after all. Better than anyone else's. She's the master here.'\n\n[Display View] Shana moves onto inspecting the recent construction. At a part that's been finished, she ponders for a moment before bringing out her recorder and beginning to examine.\n'I know what happened there. Gallen was wanting to give his family a call and rushed to finish. I thought something was off myself. Just was too busy with my own work to take a proper look in time.'\n'Shh—listen to what she's saying. 'Concrete is 3cm too thin.' That would've been a hazard lurking. So she susses out the recorders to catch stuff like this.'\n\n[Display View] Shana nonchalantly tears open a packet of mints, one of which accidentally falls onto the ground. She picks it up, blows off the dust, then pops it in her mouth like nothing happened.\n'*sigh* Funny how she's always so breezy. Guess once she's down in the mines... she'd be like any of us.'\n'Only met one other foreman as good as her in all my working life.'\n'You did?'\n'Yeah, middle-aged bloke. Didn't discriminate against us Infected, always brought his daughter to the site to eat with the crew. I would've gladly worked with him until retirement, but then one time a project he was on caught him. A potential safety hazard became an accident. Had to disband the whole construction crew after that.'\n'Shame.'\n'Been over ten years now, but I think I still vaguely remember his name. Was it... Moleman?'\n'...Y'know, our boss's full name is—Shana Moleman.'",
        "zh": "“找到了，吓死我了。要是明天上工没戴上，多少要挨头儿两句。你说头儿给大家都配上这什么……工程记录仪有什么用啊？”\n“我哪搞得懂？你手上那台一直开着的，看看你怎么把它弄丢的？”\n“成。”\n\n【显示画面】下班前，一名工人换装时顺手将工程记录仪扔在一边。\n“哈哈，你还说被人拿走了？就是你自己马虎搞丢的。”\n“嚷嚷什么。”\n\n【显示画面】工人们离开后不久，夏娜忽然来到了工区。\n“等等，这不是头儿吗？”\n\n【显示画面】夏娜清点了设备的损耗情况，一一调试运转不畅的设备。她在一台钻机前停下，掏出笔记本书写。\n“我还纳闷，明明小队人少到没有设备保养师，怎么设备都还好使，原来是头儿把活给干了。”\n“布洛克的那台钻机，前天掘进这边岩层时确实不太利索，兄弟们想着将就用，头儿却一下子发现了。”\n“毕竟我们的钻头全被头儿改进过，比别家的都好用，这方面她是行家。”\n\n【显示画面】夏娜转而检查近日的施工情况，到一处已完工的部分时，她思考后拿出工程记录仪开始查看。\n“那里我记得是小贾伦要去和家人打电话，加急赶完的。当时我就感觉不对劲，但忙着手上的活，也没来得及认真看。”\n“嘘——你听头儿怎么说的：‘混凝土厚度差了三厘米’，这安全隐患可不小。头儿通过工程记录仪发现了端倪，原来用处在这里。”\n\n【显示画面】夏娜顺手撕开了薄荷糖包装，糖不小心掉落在地，她捡起来，吹去上面的灰尘，若无其事地放进嘴里。\n“唉，头儿平时那么活泼，下了矿……和我们也没什么不同。”\n“像头儿这么好的工头，我干活这么多年只遇到过一位。”\n“你还遇见过？”\n“是啊，一个中年男人，不歧视我们感染者，还经常带女儿来矿场和工人们吃饭。我本来想跟着他一直干的，可是后来他经手的工程有安全隐患出了事故，导致施工队解散了。”\n“真可惜。”\n“虽然是十几年前的事了，但至今我还依稀记得他的姓，叫……穆伊曼？”\n“……我们的头儿，全名叫：夏娜·穆伊曼。”",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
